#: docs/index.md:8
msgid "One baby · two countries · one year Somsack is born in Thailand and grows up in Lao PDR. A year later, a Thai doctor sees every vaccine he has ever had, and no record is copied across the border. This guide is that story, told as the journeys J1 to J4 (first told in the VaxLink workshop), written down as a WHO SMART Guidelines digital adaptation kit (L2) and a FHIR implementation guide (L3). It is built on the SMART Trust HCERT libraries and WHO GDHCN. Walk through the journeys Read the journeys See the FHIR examples"
msgstr ""

